    {
      "id": "note-directions",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 900,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Five directions for the Creadigol home page. Zoom out to see them side by side.\nA \u00b7 Evolution: today's lime and charcoal kept, quieter shell, video-led work.\nB \u00b7 Broadcast: dark, full-bleed reel, lower-thirds, amber ticker, Druk Condensed.\nC \u00b7 Swiss grid, Welsh-first: white, visible 12-column grid, Welsh and English side by side, cobalt.\nD \u00b7 Kinetic colour: violet, tangerine and mint blocks, rounded media, pill navigation.\nE \u00b7 Multiview (brand new): the home page is a broadcast monitor wall of live project feeds, headline stamped across as a caption.\n\nHeadlines are set in the real Druk Web Bold and labels in Supply, both taken from the current site.\nGrey blocks are media placeholders. Square-bracket text is a fact to fill in."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-fullset",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -180,
      "w": 720,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Direction A carried through the rest of the site: mobile home, work index, a case study, studio, contact, and the editor screen for adding a case study. Whichever direction is chosen gets the same set."
    }
